1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,370
Psychiatrist: I’m a psychiatrist.

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:04,340
Psychiatrist: I want to help as many people as I can.

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,610
Psychiatrist: But there are barriers in my way.

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,670
TECTSOFT is here to help.

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,370
Psychiatrist: I see each of my patients

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,980
Psychiatrist: for one hour a week.

7
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:16,160
Psychiatrist: The other one hundred and sixty-seven hours,

8
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,380
Psychiatrist: I’m in the dark.

9
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,940
Psychiatrist: My calendar is full.

10
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,610
Psychiatrist: New patients wait for weeks.

11
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:27,140
Psychiatrist: And at 4 a.m., a patient messages me, panicking.

12
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,080
Psychiatrist: I want to help.

13
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:30,110
Psychiatrist: I just can’t be awake for everyone.

14
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:33,110
Psychiatrist: It’s all too much for one person to manage.

15
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,360
With TECTSOFT,

16
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,100
your care doesn’t stop at the session.

17
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:39,810
Your own practice app.

18
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,080
Patients check in every day:

19
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:42,800
mood, sleep, and anxiety.

20
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,930
Daily nudges build healthy habits:

21
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:48,220
journaling, walks, exercise, and better meals.

22
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:52,080
Every exercise you assign is tracked,

23
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:54,040
so you see their progress before they walk in.

24
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:57,820
At 4 a.m., AI guides them through the moment,

25
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,540
with the coping steps you’ve approved.

26
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,180
Warning signs reach you right away,

27
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,420
and crisis support is always one tap away.

28
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,540
Even people on your waitlist

29
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,980
get support while they wait.

30
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,270
Psychiatrist: Now I can help more people,

31
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:12,360
Psychiatrist: and I know how their week really went.

32
00:01:13,110 --> 00:01:15,500
Therapist, psychiatrist, or clinic?

33
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,970
Reach out to us.

34
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:18,060
Let’s build your app together,

35
00:01:18,070 --> 00:01:20,060
and help more people, every single day.
